    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιργάβωρ</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυκόφως</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱβωρ</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠώς; μιργ</span>
			- perh. cogn. with Lith. <i>mirgēti</i> 'glimmer', O<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>mirce</i> 'murky'.) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιργῶσαι:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηλῶσαι</span>, Id. (Cf. foreg.) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίρεα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάχανα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίρκα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐανθής, ποικίλη ἄνθεσι</span>, Id.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίρμα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοῦ κακοπινοῦς καὶ ῥυπαροῦ καὶ
				πονηροῦ</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίρον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν ἀπονυστάζῃ τις, λέγουσι
				Ταραντῖνοι</span>, Id.</div>
